1
00:00:16,779 --> 00:00:24,271
The letter lies upon my desk,
A cold and silent, grim request.

2
00:00:24,715 --> 00:00:33,128
It stares at me with heavy breath,
A piece of paper white as death.

3
00:00:34,199 --> 00:00:41,990
Return to sender, take it back!
Don't throw our two years off the track!

4
00:00:42,087 --> 00:00:52,608
We don't deserve this cold goodbye,
I'll put it back, don't make us die!

5
00:00:54,431 --> 00:01:02,031
I know what waits behind the seal,
The sharpest blade of cold hard steel.

6
00:01:02,286 --> 00:01:10,426
I fight the urge to break the line,
I will not read what is not mine.

7
00:01:12,115 --> 00:01:19,677
Return to sender, take it back!
Don't throw our two years off the track!

8
00:01:19,763 --> 00:01:36,188
We don't deserve this cold goodbye,
I'll put it back, don't make us die!

9
00:01:46,058 --> 00:01:53,639
The pressure grows, I break the seal,
I read the first lines that reveal.

10
00:01:53,781 --> 00:02:03,089
I hate myself for giving in,
For letting this dark end begin!

11
00:02:03,327 --> 00:02:11,168
Return to sender, take it back!
Don't throw our two years off the track!

12
00:02:11,290 --> 00:02:28,744
We don't deserve this cold goodbye,
I'll put it back, don't make us die!

13
00:02:37,368 --> 00:02:44,987
I tear the sheet in raging pain,
To drown in my own dark disdain!

14
00:02:45,278 --> 00:02:52,757
The white scraps fall into the bin,
Like snow that never melts within!

15
00:02:54,847 --> 00:03:02,784
Return to sender, take it back!
Don me throw our two years off the track!

16
00:03:03,212 --> 00:03:22,399
We don't deserve this cold goodbye,
I'll put it back, don't make us die!

17
00:03:28,732 --> 00:03:36,490
My heavy tears fall down my face,
Erasing every sacred trace.

18
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:44,871
It's over now... completely through...
There's nothing left of me and you...

